        "title": "Add SHELLRECREATED analytics event",
        "summary": "Added `SHELL_RECREATED` to `AnalyticsEvent` enum. `recreateShell` in `npm-app/src/terminal/base.ts` now tracks this event with `persistentProcess` payload. Also alphabetized existing events in `common/src/constants/analytics-events.ts`.",
